{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":8,"lang":"id","title":"Bisa, bisakah, lakukan","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"Apa yang akan kamu pelajari","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Di pelajaran ini kamu belajar bilang apa yang bisa dan tidak bisa kamu lakukan: «aku bisa menjahit», «aku tidak bisa main sepatu roda». Juga cara meminta: «bisa pinjam pulpen?», memberi perintah singkat: «colokkan» — dan bilang «jangan»: «jangan buru-buru»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can sew.","translation":"Aku bisa menjahit.","hi":"can"},{"en":"I can't skate.","translation":"Aku tidak bisa main sepatu roda.","hi":"can't"},{"en":"Can you lend me a pen?","translation":"Bisa pinjamkan aku pulpen?","hi":"Can you"},{"en":"Plug it in.","translation":"Colokkan.","hi":"Plug"},{"en":"Don't rush.","translation":"Jangan buru-buru.","hi":"Don't"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"can — «bisa»","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"can mirip «bisa»: letaknya di antara siapa dan kegiatan. I can sew — «aku bisa menjahit». Sesudah can kegiatan seperti di kamus: tanpa to dan tanpa s."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"can","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan seperti di kamus","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can sew.","translation":"Aku bisa menjahit.","hi":"can"},{"en":"He can dance.","translation":"Dia bisa menari.","hi":"can"},{"en":"I can speak English.","translation":"Aku bisa bahasa Inggris.","hi":"can"},{"en":"He can edit photos.","translation":"Dia bisa mengedit foto.","hi":"can"},{"en":"She can polish shoes.","translation":"Dia bisa menyemir sepatu.","hi":"can"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can to sew.","right":"I can sew."},{"wrong":"I can sews.","right":"I can sew."},{"wrong":"I am can translate.","right":"I can translate."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I can","after":"English.","options":["speak","to speak","speaks"],"answer":"speak","why":"Sesudah can, kegiatan tanpa to dan tanpa s."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"can tidak berubah","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Di pelajaran 6, sesudah he dan she kegiatan ditambah s. Dengan can tidak: can dan kegiatan sesudahnya sama-sama tidak berubah. He can dance, bukan He cans dance atau He can dances."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"He can dance.","translation":"Dia bisa menari.","hi":"can"},{"en":"She can polish shoes.","translation":"Dia bisa menyemir sepatu.","hi":"can"},{"en":"She can check the rating.","translation":"Dia bisa mengecek peringkatnya.","hi":"can"},{"en":"She can give feedback.","translation":"Dia bisa memberi masukan.","hi":"can"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"He cans dance.","right":"He can dance."},{"wrong":"He can dances.","right":"He can dance."},{"wrong":"She can to climb.","right":"She can climb."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"spot_slip","kind":"spot_slip","chips":["He","can","dances"],"answerIndex":2,"hint":"Ada satu kata dengan huruf s berlebih. Ketuk kata itu.","fix":"Sesudah can kegiatan tanpa s: He can dance."}}]},{"num":"04","title":"can't — «tidak bisa»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bilang «tidak bisa» — dua kata. Bahasa Inggris menggabungkannya: can't. I can't skate — «aku tidak bisa main sepatu roda». Bukan I not can, bukan I don't can."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can't skate.","translation":"Aku tidak bisa main sepatu roda.","hi":"can't"},{"en":"She can't ski.","translation":"Dia tidak bisa main ski.","hi":"can't"},{"en":"He can't dive.","translation":"Dia tidak bisa menyelam.","hi":"can't"},{"en":"I can't make the bed.","translation":"Aku tidak bisa merapikan tempat tidur.","hi":"can't"},{"en":"She can't do the ironing.","translation":"Dia tidak bisa menyetrika.","hi":"can't"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I not can skate.","right":"I can't skate."},{"wrong":"I don't can skate.","right":"I can't skate."},{"wrong":"She can't skis.","right":"She can't ski."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"Kamu tidak bisa main sepatu roda. Mana yang benar?","optionA":"I not can skate.","optionB":"I can't skate.","correct":"B","explain":"«Tidak bisa» adalah can't."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"Bertanya «bisa…?» — Can you…?","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Kita bilang «Kamu bisa berenang?» tanpa mengubah urutan. Bahasa Inggris memindahkan can ke depan: Can you swim? Bukan Are you can, bukan Do you can. Jawaban singkat: Yes, I can — «ya, bisa»."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"Can","accent":true},{"text":"siapa","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan","accent":true},{"text":"?","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Can you sew?","translation":"Kamu bisa menjahit?","hi":"Can"},{"en":"Can you hike?","translation":"Kamu bisa mendaki?","hi":"Can"},{"en":"Yes, I can.","translation":"Ya, bisa.","hi":"can"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You can swim?","right":"Can you swim?"},{"wrong":"Are you can swim?","right":"Can you swim?"},{"wrong":"Do you can swim?","right":"Can you swim?"}]}]},{"num":"06","title":"Meminta tolong: Can you…?","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Pertanyaan yang sama — Can you…? — dipakai untuk meminta tolong: Can you lend me a pen? — «bisa pinjamkan aku pulpen?». Kita juga meminta dengan «bisa…?», jadi ini sudah akrab."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Can you lend me a pen?","translation":"Bisa pinjamkan aku pulpen?","hi":"Can you"},{"en":"Can you unfasten the strap?","translation":"Bisa lepaskan talinya?","hi":"Can you"},{"en":"Can you check the buckle?","translation":"Bisa cek gespernya?","hi":"Can you"},{"en":"Can you explain it?","translation":"Bisa jelaskan?","hi":"Can you"},{"en":"Can you explain the diagram?","translation":"Bisa jelaskan diagramnya?","hi":"Can you"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You can lend me a pen?","right":"Can you lend me a pen?"},{"wrong":"Can you to explain it?","right":"Can you explain it?"}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Minta: «Bisa jelaskan diagramnya?»","answer":["Can","you","explain","the","diagram"],"distractors":["to","Do"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"Perintah singkat: kegiatan di depan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Untuk bilang «lakukan», langsung mulai dengan kegiatan, tanpa siapa: Plug it in — «colokkan», Buy semi-skimmed milk — «beli susu rendah lemak». Ini permintaan biasa sehari-hari, tidak kasar."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"kegiatan","accent":true},{"text":"apa","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Plug it in.","translation":"Colokkan.","hi":"Plug"},{"en":"Plug in the humidifier.","translation":"Colokkan pelembapnya.","hi":"Plug"},{"en":"Turn on the shredder.","translation":"Nyalakan mesin penghancur kertas.","hi":"Turn on"},{"en":"Buy low-fat yoghurt.","translation":"Beli yogurt rendah lemak.","hi":"Buy"},{"en":"Buy semi-skimmed milk.","translation":"Beli susu setengah lemak.","hi":"Buy"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"To plug it in.","right":"Plug it in."}]}]},{"num":"08","title":"«Jangan»: Don't…","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Jangan» dalam bahasa Inggris adalah Don't, di depan kegiatan: Don't rush — «jangan buru-buru». Bukan No rush atau Not rush. Supaya lebih sopan, tambah Please di depan: Please don't interrupt."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"(Please)","accent":false},{"text":"Don't","accent":true},{"text":"kegiatan","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Don't rush.","translation":"Jangan buru-buru.","hi":"Don't"},{"en":"Don't lean on it.","translation":"Jangan bersandar di situ.","hi":"Don't"},{"en":"Please don't interrupt.","translation":"Tolong jangan memotong.","hi":"Please don't"},{"en":"Don't spill it.","translation":"Jangan tumpahkan.","hi":"Don't"},{"en":"Don't panic.","translation":"Jangan panik.","hi":"Don't"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Not rush.","right":"Don't rush."},{"wrong":"No panic.","right":"Don't panic."},{"wrong":"Don't please interrupt.","right":"Please don't interrupt."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"","after":"panic.","options":["No","Not","Don't"],"answer":"Don't","why":"«Jangan» adalah Don't di depan kegiatan."}}]},{"num":"09","title":"can — juga «aku bisa bantu», «kita bisa»","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"can bukan cuma «bisa» untuk kemampuan. Juga untuk menawarkan bantuan dan bicara tentang kemungkinan: I can manage the list — «aku bisa mengurus daftarnya», We can share the workload — «kita bisa bagi pekerjaannya»."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can evaluate it.","translation":"Aku bisa menilainya.","hi":"can"},{"en":"We can choose a criterion.","translation":"Kita bisa memilih satu kriteria.","hi":"can"},{"en":"I can manage the list.","translation":"Aku bisa mengurus daftarnya.","hi":"can"},{"en":"We can share the workload.","translation":"Kita bisa bagi pekerjaannya.","hi":"can"},{"en":"I can improve it.","translation":"Aku bisa memperbaikinya.","hi":"can"}]}]},{"num":"10","title":"Kesalahan yang dibuat hampir semua orang","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can to sew.","right":"I can sew."},{"wrong":"He can dances.","right":"He can dance."},{"wrong":"I not can skate.","right":"I can't skate."},{"wrong":"You can swim?","right":"Can you swim?"},{"wrong":"Are you can swim?","right":"Can you swim?"},{"wrong":"Not rush.","right":"Don't rush."},{"wrong":"Don't please interrupt.","right":"Please don't interrupt."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"can seperti gembok untuk kegiatan: sesudahnya kegiatan selalu seperti di kamus. Tidak ada to, s, atau do."}]},{"num":"11","title":"Bekal untuk latihan","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"«Bisa» — I can + kegiatan seperti di kamus. «Tidak bisa» — can't. «Bisa…?» — Can you…? di depan. «Lakukan» — kegiatan di depan. «Jangan» — Don't…, dengan sopan — Please don't…"},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can speak English.","translation":"Aku bisa bahasa Inggris.","hi":"can"},{"en":"She can't ski.","translation":"Dia tidak bisa main ski.","hi":"can't"},{"en":"Can you check the buckle?","translation":"Bisa cek gespernya?","hi":"Can you"},{"en":"Turn on the shredder.","translation":"Nyalakan mesin penghancur kertas.","hi":"Turn on"},{"en":"Please don't interrupt.","translation":"Tolong jangan memotong.","hi":"Please don't"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{}}
